From 600355aaa2815019b2b66720ecadd58db99c0db2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:11:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(xtask): run heavy release tests before debug suites

Move the heavy targets after the two build steps. Run the heavy shared
queue and isolated targets before the ordinary targets. Keep duration
sorting within each queue and retain the existing isolation rules.

Pin the plan and actual execution order. Verify the original code and
each classification condition with mutations. Keep all step commands
and names unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2372
